From aecb8233be77a7a8d6462db1b0da687edccc9c7b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SovereignOS Build <build@sovereignos.local>
Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 19:00:31 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] sovereignos: hide real-user identity from the decoy session's
 UI surfaces

Squash of former patches:

- 0017 sovereignos: add UserManager.getUsersForUiDisplay for decoy session UI filtering
- 0018 sovereignos: route SystemUI user-switcher and power-menu through getUsersForUiDisplay
- 0019 sovereignos: route SettingsLib storage measurement through getUsersForUiDisplay
- 0020 sovereignos: mark decoy user setup-complete at registration time
- 0021 sovereignos: clear calling identity for decoy setup-complete write
- 0022 sovereignos: validate decoy user type, drop UnsupportedAppUsage
- 0023 sovereignos: treat decoy user as main-user-equivalent for Wallet QS tile
- 0024 sovereignos: fix getUsersForUiDisplay to key off current user, not caller
- 0025 sovereignos: fix legacy power-menu fallback to use getUsersForUiDisplay
- 0026 sovereignos: fix uninstall dialogs' single-user check to use getUsersForUiDisplay
- 0027 sovereignos: route areThereMultipleUiSwitchableUsers through getUsersForUiDisplay
